		{"id":"0188409f10045021","type":"text","text":"Complex system\n> A system composed of many components that interact with one another\n* Climate, brain, organisms, transportation, etc.\n(https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Complex_system)","x":-4323,"y":576,"width":424,"height":217},
		{"id":"8672862e530eeb63","type":"text","text":"Dynamical system\n> A system in which a function describes the time dependence of a point in an ambient space\n* Natural systems: fluids, weather, heart, etc.\n* Artificial systems: traffic","x":-5132,"y":632,"width":412,"height":208},
