		{"id":"589283ef43d59f7b","type":"text","text":"Topics: \n\n* Geometrical perspective and pattern visualization of complex dynamical systems\n* Chaos and attractors: https://entagma.com/vex-in-houdini-strange-attractors/\n* Fractals: https://www.sidefx.com/tutorials/vex-in-houdini-mandelbrot-and-mandelbulb/\n* Phase space, phase and space transformation, Recurrence plot, Poincare map\n* Emergence: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dUec3GXc6Tg&list=PLzRzqTjuGIDgtI8wIsWVkU2-AVyDH91QM&index=35\n* (Bio) signals and systems\n* Iteration and feedback loop: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tXY-O_893cs\n","x":-6900,"y":1680,"width":980,"height":340},
